Third-party
-----------

The ideas rill builds on are prior art: synchronous and reactive
dataflow languages, spreadsheet-style incremental evaluation, and
node-graph editors are well-published territory. The design and the
Zig implementation in this repo are original. rill depends on the
sibling struple library, which carries its own (identical, dual)
license in its own repository.

The Apache 2.0 license file applies to all source code and
documentation in this repository (`src/`, `docs/`, `build.zig`,
`build.zig.zon`, `README.md`). It does not extend to values or
programs that hosts feed through a mounted rill at runtime — those
belong to their authors.
